### Member Auth API – manual test requests (VS Code REST Client / Rider .http)
@base = http://localhost:5155

### 1. Login (seeded demo member)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jdoe",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!",
  "lob": "DENTAL"
}

### 2. Call the protected endpoint with the access token
GET {{base}}/api/v1/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Rotate the refresh token
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 4. SSO – configuration + federated sign-on URL for a LOB/SSO name (mocked PingFed in Development)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sso?lob=2100&ssoName=CHATSSO
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4b. SSO – HRA with the age-based assessment rule (dateOfBirth used only if the JWT has no birthdate claim)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sso?lob=2100&ssoName=HRA&dateOfBirth=2010-04-01
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. JWKS – public keys for downstream microservices
GET {{base}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### 6. OIDC-style discovery document
GET {{base}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

### 7. Health
GET {{base}}/health
